<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDocumentedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDocumentedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/Service> .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDocumentedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/ontology/research_product> .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDocumentedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "In SKG-IF, it is used in the following classes (domain):\n* srv:Service\n\nIn SKG-IF, it is used to link to entities belonging to the following classes (range):\n* skg:research_product" .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDocumentedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A research product (e.g. a paper or report) that documents this service." .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDocumentedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/spar/cito/> .
