# https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isDeploymentOf
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isDeploymentOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
