_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:genid3 .
_:genid3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid2 .
_:genid2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/ontology/research_product> .
_:genid2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
_:genid3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://purl.org/spar/fabio/Software> .
_:genid3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
_:genid1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isDeploymentOf> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "In SKG-IF, it is used in the following classes (domain):\n* srv:Service\n        \nIn SKG-IF, it is used to link to entities belonging to the following classes (range):\n* skg:research_product (type software)\n* fabio:Software\n\nPlain string values are treated as local_identifier cross-references to skg:research_product (type software) in the SKG-IF graph." .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isDeploymentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a Service to the software it deploys or instantiates; range is fabio:Software or skg:research_product (type software)." .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isDeploymentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isDeploymentOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "srv:isDeploymentOf (SKG-IF labels: srv_deployment_of)" .
