<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isPartOfResearchInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Organization> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isPartOfResearchInfrastructure> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "In SKG-IF, it is used in the following classes (domain):\n* srv:Service\n\nIn SKG-IF, it is used to link to entities belonging to the following classes (range):\n* foaf:Organization (type: research_infrastructure)" .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isPartOfResearchInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a Service to the research infrastructure (foaf:Organization typed research_infrastructure) it is part of." .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/isPartOfResearchInfrastructure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> .
