# 
# https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/Service> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/ontology/research_product> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "In SKG-IF, it is used in the following classes (domain):\n* srv:Service\n\nIn SKG-IF, it is used to link a Service to one or more research products \n(e.g. software, datasets, workflows, publications) that are conceptually \nrelated but not necessarily deployed by the service." .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a Service to one or more related SKG-IF research products (e.g., software, datasets, workflows). Complements `srv:isDeploymentOf` (software actually deployed)." .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/relatedResearchProduct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "srv:relatedResearchProduct (SKG-IF labels: related_products)" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/Service> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "In SKG-IF, it is used in the following classes (domain):\n* srv:Service\n\nIn SKG-IF, it is used to indicate the languages (identifiers)the Service can process (range):\n* skos:Concept" .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Values are ISO 639-3 language code IRIs from the ACDH-CH/DARIAH vocabulary (https://vocabs.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/iso6393/). Example: https://vocabs.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/iso6393/deu for German." .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/> .
<https://w3id.org/skg-if/extension/srv/ontology/supportedLanguage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "srv:supportedLanguage (SKG-IF labels: srv_supported_language)" .
