<https://w3id.org/skg-if/ontology/research_product> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "SKG-IF alias for fabio:Work. In a Service context 'research product' better expresses the intent: any scholarly output (software, dataset, publication, workflow) that a service deploys or relates to. The core JSON-LD context maps this as \"product\": \"fabio:Work\"." .
